{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此會舉秀首座立僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔灌溪和尚，僧問：「久嚮灌溪，到來只見漚麻池。」「爾只見漚麻池，且不見灌溪。如何是灌溪劈箭急？」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時請主溈山，罷赴來命。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時公晦同杜使舟行至長沙，越\n城入岳。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0213001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0213001", "type": "orig", "text": "（便宜上，表題ヲ附ス。󴦒）"}
